        "original_id": "cd185a16-88cb-5d36-8364-04e18155614a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Likwit Crew\n- People: Xzibit, Defari, Alvin Nathaniel Joiner\n- Groups: Lootpack, The Barbershop MC's\n- Topics: West Coast hip hop, Street Music, Pimp My Ride\n\nFacts:\n- The Likwit Crew is a West Coast hip hop collective.\n- Other artists who joined the Likwit Crew included Xzibit, Phil Da Agony, Lootpack, Defari, Styliztik Jones, Declaime, J. Wells, and The Barbershop MC's.\n- Alvin Nathaniel Joiner, born on September 18, 1974, is better known by the stage name Xzibit.\n- Xzibit is an American rapper, actor, television host, radio personality, and record producer.\n- Xzibit is known as the host of the MTV show Pimp My Ride, which brought him mainstream success.\n- Defari is an American hip hop musician who is part of the Likwit Crew.\n- Street Music is the third album by Defari.",
